  "proposed_english_paragraphs": [
    "The local Stage05 candidate now has separately reviewed native G3/G4 consumer evidence from a focused current-memory route. A fresh Root-approved memory descent created a new accepted controller, preserving the original acceptance and validity bounds. No historical permission or ExperienceBinding was reconstructed. This route reopens pinned raw source bytes and does not certify the complete cold ordinary console scenario.",
